#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`hashlib` --- hashing algorithms"
msgstr ":mod:`hashlib` --- algoritmi za sažimanje"

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module implements binary data hashing algorithms.  Each algorithm is "
"exposed as a class whose instances accept incremental data via ``update()`` "
"and produce a fixed-size digest via ``digest()``.  The OpenMV Cam provides "
"three algorithms:"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul implementira algoritme za sažimanje (hashing) binarnih podataka."
"  Svaki algoritam izložen je kao klasa čije instance prihvaćaju "
"inkrementalne podatke putem ``update()`` i proizvode sažetak fiksne veličine"
" putem ``digest()``\\ .  OpenMV Cam pruža tri algoritma:"

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:12
msgid ""
"SHA256 - The current generation, modern hashing algorithm (of the SHA-2 "
"series). It is suitable for cryptographically-secure purposes and is always "
"available."
msgstr ""
"SHA256 - Trenutna generacija, moderni algoritam za sažimanje (iz serije "
"SHA-2). Prikladan je za kriptografski sigurne svrhe i uvijek je dostupan."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:16
msgid ""
"SHA1 - A previous generation algorithm. Not recommended for new uses, but "
"SHA1 is part of a number of Internet standards and existing applications, so"
" it remains available."
msgstr ""
"SHA1 - Algoritam prethodne generacije. Nije preporučen za nove primjene, ali"
" SHA1 je dio brojnih internetskih standarda i postojećih aplikacija, pa "
"ostaje dostupan."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:20
msgid ""
"MD5 - A legacy algorithm, not considered cryptographically secure. Provided "
"for interoperability with legacy applications."
msgstr ""
"MD5 - Naslijeđeni algoritam, ne smatra se kriptografski sigurnim. Pruža se "
"radi interoperabilnosti s naslijeđenim aplikacijama."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:24
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klase"

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:28
msgid "Create an SHA256 hasher object and optionally feed *data* into it."
msgstr "Stvara SHA256 hasher objekt i opcionalno mu predaje *data*\\ ."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:32 ../../library/hashlib.rst:51
#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:70
msgid "Feed more binary data into the hash."
msgstr "Predaje više binarnih podataka u sažetak."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:36 ../../library/hashlib.rst:55
#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:74
msgid ""
"Return the hash of all data passed through it so far, as a bytes object. "
"After this method is called, no more data can be fed into the hash."
msgstr ""
"Vraća sažetak svih podataka koji su dosad kroz njega prošli, kao bytes "
"objekt. Nakon poziva ove metode, više se nikakvi podaci ne mogu predati u "
"sažetak."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:42 ../../library/hashlib.rst:61
#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:80
msgid ""
"``hexdigest()`` is not implemented in MicroPython. Use "
"``binascii.hexlify(h.digest())`` to obtain a hex string."
msgstr ""
"``hexdigest()`` nije implementiran u MicroPythonu. Koristite "
"``binascii.hexlify(h.digest())`` za dobivanje heksadekadskog niza."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:47
msgid "Create an SHA1 hasher object and optionally feed *data* into it."
msgstr "Stvara SHA1 hasher objekt i opcionalno mu predaje *data*\\ ."

#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:66
msgid "Create an MD5 hasher object and optionally feed *data* into it."
msgstr "Stvara MD5 hasher objekt i opcionalno mu predaje *data*\\ ."
